  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensuring the sustainability of marine resources in the Port-Gentil region of Gabon, through..artisanal and sport-fishing management areas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;This project supports marine resources and the ecological integrity of the marine zone surrounding Port-Gentil in Gabon in the creation of management plans for artisanal fisheries and in the creation of a decree regarding sport fishing. This project is intended to conserve rich biodiversity in an area known for Gabons most emblematic marine species, including humpback whales, sea turtles and sharks by addressing the impacts of unregulated artisanal and sport fisheries. Specific activities include: 1) inventory the usage of the maritime space by artisanal and sport fishers in a multi-use zone, and an oil exclusion zone, 2) gathering the various users of the area and the other actors involved to consult on the necessary measures to take to achieve the goal, and 3) proposing management actions to central administration of Gabon...&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
